# AI agent config and local rule files (docs/security.md §16).
# These are executable configuration: they can launch MCP servers, widen tool
# permissions, or inject agent rules on any machine that clones the repo. They
# stay out of version control; sharing one requires an ADR + code-owner review.
# (Tracked, reviewed exceptions: CLAUDE.md, docs/CLAUDE.md — text-only governance.)
.claude/
.mcp.json
.cursor/
.cursorrules
